## Auto-advance (standing)

After Discovery: continue Intake→Risk unless Discovery flags wrong-target or a missing business decision.  
After Risk GO with no Closed-row conflict: start Development.  
After local validation: scoped local commit, then check-in to `origin/main` (normal push only).

